# test refuses an empty home, observes the connected client's endpoint,
# and refuses a client without a selected Route.
exec aigw test --help
cmp stdout help.txt

! exec aigw test
cmp stdout empty.txt

stdin token.txt
exec aigw add team --label 'Team Gateway' --anthropic-url $UPSTREAM --model team-model --for claude --token-stdin
exec aigw test --for claude
cmp stdout tested.txt
! exec aigw test --for codex
cmp stdout codex.txt

-- token.txt --
sk-team-token-0001
-- help.txt --
AIGW  aigw test
────────────────────────────────────────
  Send a model-free HTTP request to selected endpoints without changing
  client bindings. --for and --route can target one Route; --token-stdin
  uses a one-time Token without storing it. An endpoint response does not
  prove model inference or real-client behavior.

Usage
  aigw test [flags]

Options
      --config string         Read an absolute configuration file for a one-time stdin Token test
      --for string            Client whose selected Route to test: claude, claude-desktop, codex, or hermes
  -h, --help                  help for test
      --route string          Test this Route for the explicit client without changing its binding
      --token-format string   Explicit stdin encoding: raw or go-keyring-base64 (default "raw")
      --token-stdin           Read one bounded Token through EOF for this request only; never store it
-- empty.txt --
AIGW  Action required
────────────────────────────────────────

Problem
  Not configured

Evidence
  No Routes have been created.

Impact
  No client endpoint is available to test.

Recommended action
  aigw setup
-- tested.txt --
AIGW  Connectivity test
────────────────────────────────────────
  Endpoint HTTP observation, not model inference or native-client verification.

Endpoints
  ✓ Claude             team · HTTP 200

Next
  aigw check
-- codex.txt --
AIGW  Action required
────────────────────────────────────────

Problem
  no Route selected for client "codex"

Impact
  The command could not finish; inspect current state before retrying.

Recommended action
  aigw check
